 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nZürichsee Handels AG                                           MASTER SERVICES\nIndustriestrasse 55, 1201 Genève, Switzerland                         AGREEMENT\nMWST-Nr: CHE-571.070.484 MWST\n\nFROM\n\nZürichsee Handels AG                                           RECHNUNGSADRESSE\nIndustriestrasse 55                                            Helvetia Präzision AG\n1201 Genève                                                    Industriestrasse 55\nSwitzerland                                                    1201 Genève\nVAT: CHE-571.070.484 MWST                                      Switzerland\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 05.03.2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Zürichsee Handels AG, with its registered office at Industriestrasse 55, Genève\n(\"Party A\"), and Helvetia Präzision AG, with its registered office at Industriestrasse 55, Genève\n(\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A   Zürichsee Handels AG / Marc Dubois\nParty B   Helvetia Präzision AG / Beat Steiner\nDate      05.03.2026",
